opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Pure OCaml Cosmos SDK client and signer library"
description: """
The offline surface: types, crypto, generated wire bindings, transaction
construction and the typed RPC protocol. Transports are deliberately absent
-- cosmos-rpc-flow, cosmos-rpc-grpc and cosmos-rpc-unix are separate packages
so that a consumer linking this one takes on no Lwt, no Unix and no socket."""
